				"&r&6&lCaramel Cube&r is a rare hostile mob found in the &d&lCandy Cavity&r, acting as a tougher, oozing variant of a standard slime. This sticky monster hops after adventurers without letting up, always trying to close the gap."
				""
				"每当受到伤害时，它会留下黏在地上的焦糖熔浆，使踏入其中的玩家或生物减速两秒。这些方块有三种不同大小，击败后会分裂成更小的&6&l焦糖方块&r。"
